speechtext:
That clause 6 be amended as follows:
1.	in line 32, by deleting the word "and" and by substituting therefor the following "(b) for the purpose of, and related only to, its operations," so that the last part of paragraph (a) becomes a new paragraph of clause 6;
2.	in line 37, by deleting the words "for the purpose of its undertaking";
3.	by deleting at the end of the present paragraph (a) as amended in the standing committee the words "for the purpose of its undertaking"; and
4.	by relettering paragraphs (b) and (c) as (c) and (d).
